{
  "slug": "2026-11-28-1744",
  "title": "The Promise on the Goatskin",
  "film": true,
  "seed": 7,
  "tempo": 1.05,
  "voice_label": "eleven:jackson-v4",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "A loan from sixteen forty-eight still pays interest today."
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine you run a Dutch water board, and the river's eating your dike."
    },
    {
      "text": "So you write a promise on goatskin."
    },
    {
      "text": "Lend us a thousand guilders, and we'll pay five percent. Forever."
    },
    {
      "text": "A man named Niclaes de Meijer signs."
    },
    {
      "text": "Soon the rate gets halved, but the payments keep coming."
    },
    {
      "text": "They're scribbled on the goatskin till it's full, so they attach paper."
    },
    {
      "text": "In two thousand three, Yale buys it at auction."
    },
    {
      "text": "Twelve years later, it collects. One hundred thirty-six euros, for twelve years."
    },
    {
      "text": "So where did the money go?"
    },
    {
      "text": "You see, it's like grandma's birthday card with the same five dollars, every year."
    },
    {
      "text": "The card never changes. What five dollars buys does."
    },
    {
      "text": "Prices rose for centuries, and every coin shrank."
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, forever pays eleven euros thirty-five a year."
    },
    {
      "text": "Every promise was kept.",
      "twist": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The money just melted.",
      "finale": true
    }
  ],
